{"unit_id":"tony92921__dsh-compact-manager#card-zh","repo":"tony92921/dsh-compact-manager","commit":"f766d3817f48595a4bf8bfd1209a5652154d6ee8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-manager 是面向 DSH Web 与 dsh-go 客户端的上下文压缩管理插件。它接管压缩引擎并提供设置面板、会话上下文弹层按钮和 /fast-compact 命令。用户可选择模型摘要压缩或本地机械折页，设置自动触发阈值与保留比例，并配置模型失败后的备用模型；它还会在发送前裁整形过大的工具结果。适合需要控制长会话上下文、减少模型压缩调用或调试压缩策略的 DSH 用户。模型压缩使用 DSH 已配置的模型，机械折页不调用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:149-174","lib/controller.js:180-220","lib/native.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"tony92921__dsh-compact-manager#card-en","repo":"tony92921/dsh-compact-manager","commit":"f766d3817f48595a4bf8bfd1209a5652154d6ee8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compact-manager manages DSH context compaction through model summaries or local folding. It adds settings and conversation controls, automatic trigger thresholds, model fallback, and pre-send shaping of oversized tool results. It helps manage long sessions; local folding uses no model call.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:149-174","lib/controller.js:180-220","lib/native.js:1-30"]}
