{"unit_id":"tony92921__dsh-compact-manager#feature-1","repo":"tony92921/dsh-compact-manager","commit":"f766d3817f48595a4bf8bfd1209a5652154d6ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-manager 的功能「手动和自动压缩」：模型模式可按官方摘要器优先或直接使用备用模型运行，并支持配置备用模型回退；自动压力压缩使用可调触发与保留阈值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/controller.js:180-220"]}
{"unit_id":"tony92921__dsh-compact-manager#feature-2","repo":"tony92921/dsh-compact-manager","commit":"f766d3817f48595a4bf8bfd1209a5652154d6ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-manager 的功能「机械折页」：用户可触发本地折页，把较早的会话内容整理成短卡而不调用压缩模型；折页通过统一压缩事务替换选定历史区间。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/ledger/fold.js:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"tony92921__dsh-compact-manager#feature-3","repo":"tony92921/dsh-compact-manager","commit":"f766d3817f48595a4bf8bfd1209a5652154d6ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-manager 的功能「入境工具结果定形」：插件在下一次请求发送前检查刚完成步骤中的大工具结果，生成节选并可按条件附加文字图像表示，以减少输入长度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/ledger/ingress.js:1-36"]}
{"unit_id":"tony92921__dsh-compact-manager#feature-4","repo":"tony92921/dsh-compact-manager","commit":"f766d3817f48595a4bf8bfd1209a5652154d6ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-manager 的功能「压缩设置和模型探测」：设置界面可调整模型、自动阈值及机械折页参数，并对配置的模型发送不同长度的压缩请求以查看结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:580-632"]}
